This package contains terminal-UI machinery adapted from the PostHog wizard
(https://github.com/PostHog/wizard), used under the MIT License. The files
below are derived works; each carries a pointer back to this notice.

  src/ui/wizard-ui.ts            the WizardUI seam with no prompt methods
  src/ui/tui/terminal.ts         alternate-screen enter and release
  src/ui/tui/router.ts           state-driven router: show/isComplete + overlays
  src/ui/tui/store.ts            the gate pattern for parking flow on the UI
  src/ui/tui/keybindings.ts      keybindings as data that register their hints
  src/ui/tui/start-tui.ts        alt screen, teardown, one exit line after it
  src/wizard/exit-line.ts        the hand-built exit line printed to scrollback
  test/support/pty.ts            PTY plus headless-terminal capture harness

